RP2040 Dual Vision Thermal

The lesson sequence follows umeiko/ESP32_Dual_Vision_Thermal.
https://github.com/umeiko/ESP32_Dual_Vision_Thermal

The PlatformIO onboarding guide and five UI screenshots in
examples/01_hello_world are adapted from that repository's first lesson.
https://github.com/umeiko/ESP32_Dual_Vision_Thermal/tree/fe181c71480a09a115e08885b692dc694c452fd2/1_hello_world

The HTPA32x32 5.0 lookup table in include/heimann_lut.hpp is adapted from
the ESP32 teaching repository's public Heimann example. Its upstream driver
identifies Heimann Sensor GmbH and Dennis Pauer as its authors.
https://github.com/umeiko/ESP32_Dual_Vision_Thermal/blob/fe181c71480a09a115e08885b692dc694c452fd2/7_heimann32x32/src/probe/def.h

Melexis MLX90640 API in lib/MelexisMLX90640/src/MLX90640_API.c,
MLX90640_API.h and MLX90640_I2C_Driver.h is copyright Melexis N.V.
and remains under Apache-2.0. Its license is included in that directory.
https://github.com/melexis/mlx90640-library/tree/f6be7ca1d4a55146b705f3d347f84b773b29cc86

Arduino-Pico, its bundled PicoCamera library, and the Adafruit display
libraries are obtained as build dependencies under their respective licenses.
